Subject: [PATCH 12/12] webapp: no Recent mentions, and no Invite Members under
 direct messages

Nobody mentions the person in a workspace of agents; questions and approvals
come as cards. A conversation is with an agent, and agents are not invited.

docs/guides/agent-workspace-design.md, Workspace controls.
